## TIẾNG ANH · 16:30–17:00 — Thứ Hai: Daily Standup

### 16:30–16:40 · Shadowing

Dùng video Callstack về TurboModule — người nói là kỹ sư Ba Lan, giọng rõ, tốc độ vừa.

### 16:40–16:55 · Standup có ghi âm

> *"Morning. Last week I finished the testing work — unit tests, component tests, and three Maestro end-to-end flows.*
> *This week I'm going into the New Architecture. Today was mostly reading and setup: I went through how JSI, Fabric and TurboModules fit together, wrote a TypeScript spec for a small device-stats module, and ran Codegen to see what it generates.*
> *Tomorrow I'll implement the Android side in Kotlin.*
> *One thing that clicked for me today is that the spec file is the single source of truth — Codegen generates the native interfaces from it, so the three sides can't drift apart. In the old architecture you wrote all three by hand and kept them in sync yourself."*

### 16:55–17:00 · 5 từ mới

| Từ / cụm | Nghĩa | Câu mẫu |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `click` (v, nghĩa bóng) | vỡ ra, hiểu ra | *One thing that clicked for me today…* |
| `single source of truth` | nguồn sự thật duy nhất | *The spec is the single source of truth.* |
| `drift apart` | lệch nhau dần | *The three sides can't drift apart.* |
| `serialise` (v) | nối chuỗi hóa dữ liệu | *The old bridge serialised everything to JSON.* |
| `under the hood` | bên trong, cơ chế ngầm | *Under the hood it's C++.* |

